WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Welcome to JobTrack AI. Here's how it works.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.167
First, add an application. Enter the job title and company.

3
00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:12.967
Then, choose where you found it, and set its status.

4
00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:17.967
Paste the job description and tick the required skills, then save.

5
00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:23.533
Next, open the application and upload your resume as a PDF.

6
00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:27.467
Select Analyze Job Match, and give it a moment.

7
00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:36.233
Your match score shows how well your resume aligns with the job's requirements. It's not a hiring prediction.

8
00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:43.133
Below, you'll see which requirements are met, partly met, or missing, with evidence from your resume.

9
00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:49.000
As things move forward, edit the application and update its status.

10
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.733
Your dashboard keeps track of everything in one place.

11
00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:59.667
You're all set. Add your first application to get started.

